            Logical
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/disjunction"} disjunction
            of such slice objects is given by the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28-1%29-truncation"} (-1)-truncation
            of their
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coproduct"} coproduct
            in the slice. Using that coproducts in slices are computed in the ambient category (see
            = succeed ")" do
              %a{:href => "over+category#LimitsAndColimits"} there
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/image"} image
            of the abstract
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/direct+sum"} direct sum
            of the subspaces, which is the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/linear+span"} linear span
